Author: Goheeca

Cabal:

Getting started:
Download & install Haskell Platform:
https://www.haskell.org/platform/

Installation:
cabal install -j -O2

Run:
cabal run

Documentation:
cabal haddock --executables --haddock-options="-q relative"

Stack:

Getting started:
Download & Install Stack:
https://haskellstack.org/

Build:
stack build

Run:
stack exec ReifiableElliptic
